    "detailed_description": "&quot;Crocs World Construction Kit 2&quot; is finally there!<br />\r\nDid you ever dream of creating and playing your own Jump'n'Run levels? Now you can do it by creating and playing your own custom levels of Croc's World! <br />\r\nYou can publish your levels on the internet and other players can play them as well!<br />\r\nAnd if you don\u00b4t want to create any levels you can just choose from tons of levels created by others!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Editor to create your own jump'n'run levels<br />\r\n- 6 different settings to choose from<br />\r\n- 48 items to choose from<br />\r\n- 6 endbosses<br />\r\n- publish your own levels on the internet<br />\r\n- play levels created by others",
